title: "A trace shear proves the Li–Li–Helleseth–Qu bent-function conjecture"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "The 2023 Li–Li–Helleseth–Qu Conjecture 2 holds for every positive parameter. An explicit linear shear puts the family into completed Maiorana–McFarland form and determines the signed Walsh spectrum. The underlying permutation theorem is credited to Ding and Zieve."
